      "canonical_latex": "\\lambda_{n-1} P_{n-1} = \\mu_n P_n,\\qquad P_n = P_0 \\prod_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{\\lambda_{k-1}}{\\mu_k}\\quad (n \\ge 1)",
